.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
terraform.tfvars
*.pem
crash.log
crash.*.log
# Saved plan files are binary and can embed sensitive resource values
# (e.g. tls_private_key's private key material) even for resources marked
# "sensitive" in `terraform plan`'s human-readable output — the underlying
# .tfplan binary is not redacted the same way. Never commit these.
tfplan*
